# p7 part one: exact error coordinates for the answer-differing arms
# format: REGION<TAB>ARM<TAB>mean_relative_error

# decimal-quantiser-radix-sweep
# controlled band: both operands (mag in [10^6,10^7), exp = 0), so
# both radices denote the identical real. 200000 trials, exact rational.
decimal-quantiser-radix-sweep	quantiser-radix2	1.755491785840e-9
decimal-quantiser-radix-sweep	quantiser-radix10	1.161072102296e-7

